This game is so underrated. It's one of the best zombie games I ever played. Here are some pro's and con's:
+ The graphics are stunning;
+ Gameplay is awesome;
+ Soundseffects seem to be recorded binaural, it sounds so good and realistic;
+ The different gamemodes are thrilling and fun;
+ So is the whole multiplayer expierence;
+ Large and beautiful maps;
+ Zombies act and look realistic;
- Just a small group of players online daily;
- Not a big variety of maps.
Just buy this game! It's on summersale at the moment for under €5,-. Help repopulate this awesome game.

This is a great game just as the other one. The soundtrack is still really exciting, the controls (although it was changed a bit) are still really nice and the story is involving. The latter is just a bit confusing but still really great!
Pros:
- Soundtrack;
- Controls;
- Gore;
- More gore;
- Cartoonish Ghaphics;
Cons:
- Glitches;
- Level design - this is the worst thing in my opinion and differs a lot from the first one. Hand-in-hand combat is pratically useless due to the new levels;
- Story - could have been a bit more elaborated; still okay though;
- Short game experience;
Should you buy this? Yes. It is not as great as the first one but you can still have a lot of fun.

